{
    "title": "Archer: Gay Dating & Gay Chat",
    "description": "Aim high, shoot higher with Archer, the community for gay dating & social  networking!\ud83c\udff9 By gay men, for gay men, Archer helps you discover just what you\u2019re looking for\u2014 find friends from the LGBTQ+ community or find your soulmate. Our app celebrates the diversity of the gay community, providing a welcoming space.\r\n\r\nOn the Archer gay dating app, every profile is shows a face! The app offers unique discovery experiences, like profile tags for finding people with common interests, open messaging and more. Chat and go on fun casual dates with cute guys in your area!\r\n\r\nArcher is an inclusive, gay and queer dating app, where you can chat and meet everyone from a bear to a twink or a daddy to a bro, and everything in between. If you identify as gay, bi, pan, queer, transgender, bigender, genderqueer, or questioning, this is your place. Discover a vibrant gay community on our app where gay chatting is not just a feature, but a celebration of connections, friendships, and maybe something more \u2013 join the conversation and make meaningful connections today!\r\n\r\nInformed by a community of gay men, from employees to LGBTQ+ orgs, from our community advocates to thousands of hours of research, Archer sets a new gay dating standard.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking for new friends, to chat with your all-time crush, a serious relationship, or anything in between, Archer is the only social gay dating app you\u2019ll ever need!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udff9Share private albums\r\n\ud83c\udff9Find exactly what you\u2019re into with Archer tags that cover everything from travel to food, from fitness to position\r\n\ud83c\udff9Enjoy a safe space for real connections - with selfie verification, health resources, and advanced trust and safety features\r\n\ud83c\udff9Follow and date cute guys and gay men near you\r\n\ud83c\udff9Participate in Archer\u2019s social feed with weekly featured prompts\r\n\ud83c\udff9View one or many with our alternate view options\r\n\r\nSearch Without Secrecy\r\nWith engaging ways to discover, safe ways to verify, and new ways to come together, the Archer gay dating app is your place to search without secrecy. Anonymous torsos are out, your gorgeous self - IN! Archer helps you meet real people and go on the best gay dates.\r\n\r\nNew Ways to Connect\r\nShare more photos of yourself and what you\u2019re into on your profile.\r\nLikely coming soon in the Archer gay dating app - post stories, go live, and join community group gay chats.\r\n\r\nArcher is your go-to app for forming connections within the gay community. Whether you want to find friends, commit to a serious relationship, or find something in between, or if you just want to meet new queer people and share what you\u2019re up to! Our app is designed to help you connect with a potential gay partner and create a fulfilling journey as a gay couple.\r\n\r\nNext-Level Safety and Security\r\nWith a focus on creating a safe and inclusive environment for the queer community, Archer caters to men of all backgrounds and preferences and was created to serve the community\u2019s unique needs. Casual encounters or long-term relationships can both be found on Archer, and whether you\u2019re a gym rat or a fabulous queen, this gay dating app is for you!\r\n\r\nAt Archer, we take the safety and security of our users seriously. That's why we use the latest technology to protect your data and privacy. Our platform is encrypted, and we have a dedicated team of moderators who work around the clock to help keep our community safe and respectful.\r\n\r\nWe require all users to take our Archer pledge to treat everyone respectfully and abide by our community guidelines that promote kindness, safety, and meaningful connections -fostering a positive space for everyone to explore and connect through Archer.\r\n\r\nJoin Archer today! Archer is available in the US, but we\u2019ll soon be available in cities around the world!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Aim high, shoot higher with Archer, the community for gay dating &amp; social  networking!\ud83c\udff9 By gay men, for gay men, Archer helps you discover just what you\u2019re looking for\u2014 find friends from the LGBTQ+ community or find your soulmate. Our app celebrates the diversity of the gay community, providing a welcoming space.<br><br>On the Archer gay dating app, every profile is shows a face! The app offers unique discovery experiences, like profile tags for finding people with common interests, open messaging and more. Chat and go on fun casual dates with cute guys in your area!<br><br>Archer is an inclusive, gay and queer dating app, where you can chat and meet everyone from a bear to a twink or a daddy to a bro, and everything in between. If you identify as gay, bi, pan, queer, transgender, bigender, genderqueer, or questioning, this is your place. Discover a vibrant gay community on our app where gay chatting is not just a feature, but a celebration of connections, friendships, and maybe something more \u2013 join the conversation and make meaningful connections today!<br><br>Informed by a community of gay men, from employees to LGBTQ+ orgs, from our community advocates to thousands of hours of research, Archer sets a new gay dating standard.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re looking for new friends, to chat with your all-time crush, a serious relationship, or anything in between, Archer is the only social gay dating app you\u2019ll ever need!<br><br>\ud83c\udff9Share private albums<br>\ud83c\udff9Find exactly what you\u2019re into with Archer tags that cover everything from travel to food, from fitness to position<br>\ud83c\udff9Enjoy a safe space for real connections - with selfie verification, health resources, and advanced trust and safety features<br>\ud83c\udff9Follow and date cute guys and gay men near you<br>\ud83c\udff9Participate in Archer\u2019s social feed with weekly featured prompts<br>\ud83c\udff9View one or many with 